<title>CHINA: Shui Hing year net loss HK$26.83 mln.</title>
<headline>Shui Hing year net loss HK$26.83 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   41.0 loss  vs  19.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0	 vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    26.83 loss vs  12.33 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     242.91     vs  347.11</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shui Hing Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 12-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Shui Hing operates department stores, speciality stores and supermarkets and is engaged in property investment.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 12 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs 12.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
